---
import '../../styles/faq.css';
---

<section id="faq" class="faq-section section-pad">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading centered">
      <p class="label muted">Common questions</p>
      <h2>Before you reserve your seat</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details>
        <summary>Is Class 8 too early for career guidance?</summary>
        <p>Class 8 is ideal for foundational understanding before the pressure of board exams begins. It helps parents and students observe aptitudes calmly.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can an assessment decide my child's future?</summary>
        <p>No assessment makes a final decision. It provides structured inputs that guide discussions and highlight natural strengths.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Why is the webinar priced at Rs.99?</summary>
        <p>The minimal fee keeps the session focused on committed parents while keeping the first step accessible.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What happens after the webinar?</summary>
        <p>You can stop at the webinar, ask follow-up questions, or upgrade to the Rs.6,499 report package or Rs.8,499 consultation package.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
